<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [730].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>730&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;RYE-BRAN MRS</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Lactobacilli MRS broth (BD-Difco)                      </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;55.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Rye-bran extract (see below)                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;900.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;100.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
<I>Rye-bran extract:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Rye-bran                                              </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;40.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Malted wheat meal                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;2.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trypsin (Sigma-Aldrich)                                </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.8&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Mix components and incubate at 50C for 24 hr. Clarify the resulting turbid liquid by centrifugation (500 x g, 15 min) followed by paper-filtration.       <br>
